      <chord name="G"/>Through darkness <chord name="D/A"/>and <chord name="C/G"/>perplexity <chord name="F#dim"/>Point <chord name="G/D"/>Thou <chord name="D7/C"/>the <chord name="Em/B"/>heavenly <chord name="C/G"/>way.
