      <chord name="G"/>To <chord name="D/A"/>Father, <chord name="C/G"/>Spirit, <chord name="G"/>and to <chord name="F#dim"/>Thee, <chord name="G/D"/>The <chord name="D7/C"/>strains <chord name="Em/B"/>of <chord name="Bm"/>praise and <chord name="C/G"/>love.
